# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, City & Guild — Chapter One: Towns & Cities (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** City & Guild (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Chapter One (pp. 7–36)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Chapter One’s narrative, verbatim: how towns are founded and chartered, their structure and
> buildings, the people who live in them, disease and medicine, crime, law and judicial
> procedure, and a tour of the great cities of Mythic Europe. Mechanics are records elsewhere:
> `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-towns-and-cities-ordeals.ttrpg`, `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-towns-and-cities-virtues-flaws.ttrpg`,
> `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-towns-and-cities-tables.ttrpg` and `armdef-city-and-guild-0.5-towns-and-cities-sidebars.ttrpg`.

